{"id":"n59922-1-7","stage":4,"title":"부시다 · 耀眼","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59922-1-7-1","ko":"주말인데 왜 이렇게 일찍 일어났어?","zh":"今天是周末，怎么这么早就起床了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말인데","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일어났어?","meaning":"起，起床，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起床，起来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"2","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起床，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"从睡眠中醒来。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f36bd1da5e3e23c8bffc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59922-1-7-2","ko":"햇살에 눈이 부셔서 저절로 잠이 깼어.","zh":"阳光太刺眼，不知不觉就醒了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"햇살에","meaning":"阳光，日光","explanation":"햇살：阳光，日光；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"햇살","audio":"/audio/1436beae29371a857708.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72477","senseId":"1","lemma":"햇살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈이","meaning":"雪","explanation":"눈：雪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20198","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부셔서","meaning":"耀眼，刺眼，夺目","explanation":"부시다：耀眼，刺眼，夺目；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"부시다","audio":"/audio/bece8542087d103aeb1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59922","senseId":"1","lemma":"부시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저절로","meaning":"自然而然地，油然而生地","explanation":"저절로：自然而然地，油然而生地","readings":[{"term":"저절로","audio":"/audio/b19437138a62d970739b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25019","senseId":"1","lemma":"저절로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠이","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깼어.","meaning":"睡醒","explanation":"깨다：睡醒；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"깨다","audio":"/audio/f06d1a21bd6ecee5f09d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62332","senseId":"3","lemma":"깨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1436beae29371a85","term":"햇살","zh":"阳光，日光","audio":"/audio/1436beae29371a857708.mp3","entryId":"72477","definition":"太阳发射的光线。","pronunciation":["해쌀","핻쌀"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"雪","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"20198","definition":"空气中的水气结冰后掉到地面后形成的白色棉花状小冰块。","pronunciation":["눈ː"]},{"id":"bece8542087d103a","term":"부시다","zh":"耀眼，刺眼，夺目","audio":"/audio/bece8542087d103aeb1d.mp3","entryId":"59922","definition":"因光线太亮或太强而很难直视。","pronunciation":["부시다"]},{"id":"b19437138a62d970","term":"저절로","zh":"自然而然地，油然而生地","audio":"/audio/b19437138a62d970739b.mp3","entryId":"25019","definition":"不借助别的力量而自动地；或不费力气而自然地。","pronunciation":["저절로"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"f06d1a21bd6ecee5","term":"깨다","zh":"睡醒","audio":"/audio/f06d1a21bd6ecee5f09d.mp3","entryId":"62332","definition":"摆脱熟睡的状态而苏醒过来；或使之那样子。","pronunciation":["깨ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c09ebdc78ee24f6d508.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59922","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7143,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天是周末，怎么这么早就起床了？","阳光太刺眼，不知不觉就醒了。","您有收到正式文件吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天是周末，怎么这么早就起床了？","阳光太刺眼，不知不觉就醒了。","您有收到正式文件吗？"],"answer":1}]}
